{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/774460-dark-ages-spirits-of-the-weaver","id":774460,"title":"Dark Ages Spirits...of the Weaver","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness","Werewolf: The Apocalypse"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-11-25T19:01:58-08:00","id":774460,"title":"Dark Ages Spirits...of the Weaver","content":"Walls being built to keep out barbarian tribes. New travel vehicles, new roads being established for commerce and teade. more mills, more out posts and sentry stations being built. New towns, cities, politics and bath complexes, lead pipes carrying hot water from natural springs. Aqueducts and more things.<br /> <br /> The spread of Dogmatic, the slow build but growing acceptance from scholars of old scientific beliefs and practices. <br /> <br /> I'm wondering what spirit Servants of the Weaver at this time might have looked like. Whether you'd have them different or not, similar to now but with different appearances and names referred to as, just chime in.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7706-somuchlove","name":"Somuchlove","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7706_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-25T20:04:23-08:00","id":774497,"title":"","content":"Well I would imagine a pattern spider during the renaissance would look like some DaVinci clockwork creation, while during the dark ages it would be some kinda wood and rope contraption.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-25T21:25:16-08:00","id":774529,"title":"","content":"I would have them look more like natural spiders, though astonishingly uniform in appearance, perhaps with Abrahamic motifs. Back then the Weaver had a lot more eggs in its religion basket than it did in its technology basket. <br /> <br /> Perhaps there would be a variety of weaver spider spirits but, like the church's castes, they would be divided in appearance with some the equivalent of humble monks, perhaps brown in appearance, and others bright red, like cardinals, symbolizing their high rank and closeness to the Weaver.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/986-mercurial","name":"Mercurial","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar986_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-25T22:04:47-08:00","id":774549,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/774460-dark-ages-spirits-of-the-weaver?p=774529#post774529\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would have them look more like natural spiders, though astonishingly uniform in appearance, perhaps with Abrahamic motifs. Back then the Weaver had a lot more eggs in its religion basket than it did in its technology basket.<br /> <br /> Perhaps there would be a variety of weaver spider spirits but, like the church's castes, they would be divided in appearance with some the equivalent of humble monks, perhaps brown in appearance, and others bright red, like cardinals, symbolizing their high rank and closeness to the Weaver.</div> </div> </div> </div>Stained glass would probably figure in prominently.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T00:25:51-08:00","id":774582,"title":"","content":"I could imagine the first data spirits living in the double-entry ledgers of the Medici banks as literal &quot;spidery handwriting&quot;.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8485-random_interrupt","name":"Random_Interrupt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8485_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"39"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T00:41:00-08:00","id":774588,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/774460-dark-ages-spirits-of-the-weaver?p=774497#post774497\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Well I would imagine a pattern spider during the renaissance would look like some DaVinci clockwork creation, while during the dark ages it would be some kinda wood and rope contraption.</div> </div> </div> </div>I love this! Any opportunity for a clockwork anything. I was thinking have the spiders with appendages suitable for a type of craft too. Stone cutters, Glass workers etc. But the wood and rope Pattern spiders is also particularly inspired. I shall steal this with loving adoration of the idea. Thank you Dwight!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7706-somuchlove","name":"Somuchlove","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7706_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T00:48:46-08:00","id":774591,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mercurial</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/774460-dark-ages-spirits-of-the-weaver?p=774529#post774529\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I would have them look more like natural spiders, though astonishingly uniform in appearance, perhaps with Abrahamic motifs. Back then the Weaver had a lot more eggs in its religion basket than it did in its technology basket. <br /> <br /> Perhaps there would be a variety of weaver spider spirits but, like the church's castes, they would be divided in appearance with some the equivalent of humble monks, perhaps brown in appearance, and others bright red, like cardinals, symbolizing their high rank and closeness to the Weaver.</div> </div> </div> </div>I have this idea where depending on where you are in regards to civilastion will highlight which strange new unseen spirits ( to most wyld dwelling garou anyway) a warder of man or bonegnawer will come across. Similarly to this I though maybe strange hooded man sized shapes walking in a line all chittering in 'one song' pitch and tone varying on which religions or spiritual beliefs were most prominently organised or In power in the area. They were to be whole swarms of cockroach per hooded robe collecting docttine and practices.<br /> <br /> but now I abdolutely have to go with them having different colours and motifs. Cardinals, monks, druids. Thank you for this!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7706-somuchlove","name":"Somuchlove","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7706_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T00:51:55-08:00","id":774592,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Saur Ops Specialist</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/774460-dark-ages-spirits-of-the-weaver?p=774549#post774549\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Stained glass would probably figure in prominently.</div> </div> </div> </div>This idea is so perfect it gives me shame that I had not considered it all. Thank you so very much!<br /> <br /> I had thought maybe some with hour glass bodies working through the day as time shifts the sands of their wotking pattern. While speaking to each othet in clicks and clacks resembling the sounds of an Abacus.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7706-somuchlove","name":"Somuchlove","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7706_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T00:55:39-08:00","id":774595,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Random_Interrupt</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/774460-dark-ages-spirits-of-the-weaver?p=774582#post774582\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I could imagine the first data spirits living in the double-entry ledgers of the Medici banks as literal &amp;quot;spidery handwriting&amp;quot;.</div> </div> </div> </div>Also a good idea thank you! Weaver spirits capturing and co-ordinating thoughts and speech and slowly aligning them in areas as to reinfirce defined speech and literacy. Reforming dialects and amalgamating similarities between tribes and areas into defined dialects and less languages.<br /> <br /> Weaver you clever thing you.<br /> <br /> Thank you everyone!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7706-somuchlove","name":"Somuchlove","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7706_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T06:35:49-08:00","id":774741,"title":"","content":"curious now that the questions been asked can I ask how spirits might be in rome?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imagizer.imageshack.us/a/img829/1897/8seg.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/2iw20supportergarou125p\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://imageshack.com/i/0j5hz8j\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.com/i/idnSdTJkj\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://i.imgsafe.org/97fd805379.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1153-prince-of-the-night","name":"Prince of the Night","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4205"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-11-26T07:03:25-08:00","id":774764,"title":"","content":"Pretty much everything above. Additionally I'll be linking in common spirit representatives of the tribes in power and spirits in line with gods/deities worshipped within and around places of commerce, politics etc.<br /> <br /> so you could do similar for parts of rome if you wanted.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7706-somuchlove","name":"Somuchlove","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7706_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-02T21:35:37-08:00","id":778800,"title":"","content":"Cutting edge technology of the Middle Ages to consider for inspiration.<br /> <br /> 1) Mechanical clocks<br /> 2) Spinning Wheel<br /> 3) Water/Wind Mills<br /> 4) Printing Press<br /> 5) Hour Glass<br /> 6) Cranes<br /> 7) Optics (eye glasses)<br /> 8) Compasses<br /> 9) University System<br /> 10) Advanced Mettalurgy (blast furnace, plate armor, bells/cannon making)<br /> 11) Cathedral Building - rib vaults, stain glass, flying buttress)<br /> 12) Mechanical artillery<br /> <br /> Common themes include - mastery of time and space, harnessing the power of the natural world, institutionalized learning, use of glass in innovative ways, architecture, and precision gears. <br /> <br /> I would use spirits that reflect how humanity is imposing his will on the world to make it ordered and more understandable. You can likely take some inspiration from the incipient Order of Reason in Mage: the Sorcerer's Crusade despite that technically being a few hundred years after the Middle Ages.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3046-black-fox","name":"Black Fox","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-03T01:11:53-08:00","id":778852,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Prince of the Night</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/774460-dark-ages-spirits-of-the-weaver?p=774741#post774741\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">curious now that the questions been asked can I ask how spirits might be in rome?</div> </div> </div> </div> The local spirit court would probably be a Senate depending on the Roman era. Just avoid the umbral side of the vomitorium.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":3953,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","user":"Dwight","date":".  Reasons! 12-03-2015, 04:17 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3953-dwight","name":"Dwight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3953_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-03T04:40:56-08:00","id":778920,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/774460-dark-ages-spirits-of-the-weaver?p=778852#post778852\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The local spirit court would probably be a Senate depending on the Roman era. Just avoid the umbral side of the vomitorium.</div> </div> </div> </div>Dwight, you git, you just made me spew my lunch all over the keyboard!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8760-cogliostro","name":"Cogliostro","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8760_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-03T06:52:09-08:00","id":778968,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Black Fox</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/774460-dark-ages-spirits-of-the-weaver?p=778800#post778800\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Cutting edge technology of the Middle Ages to consider for inspiration.<br /> <br /> 1) Mechanical clocks<br /> 2) Spinning Wheel<br /> 3) Water/Wind Mills<br /> 4) Printing Press<br /> 5) Hour Glass<br /> 6) Cranes<br /> 7) Optics (eye glasses)<br /> 8) Compasses<br /> 9) University System<br /> 10) Advanced Mettalurgy (blast furnace, plate armor, bells/cannon making)<br /> 11) Cathedral Building - rib vaults, stain glass, flying buttress)<br /> 12) Mechanical artillery<br /> <br /> Common themes include - mastery of time and space, harnessing the power of the natural world, institutionalized learning, use of glass in innovative ways, architecture, and precision gears. <br /> <br /> I would use spirits that reflect how humanity is imposing his will on the world to make it ordered and more understandable. You can likely take some inspiration from the incipient Order of Reason in Mage: the Sorcerer's Crusade despite that technically being a few hundred years after the Middle Ages.</div> </div> </div> </div>Genius! And very helpful. Thank you muchly!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/7706-somuchlove","name":"Somuchlove","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar7706_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"187"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-12-03T06:52:53-08:00","id":778970,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Dwight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-apocalypse-aa/774460-dark-ages-spirits-of-the-weaver?p=778852#post778852\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> The local spirit court would probably be a 